## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

### What it does (based on actual code, not comments)
A **role-based college management REST API** for RYMEC college with three roles:
- **Admin** — creates users (students/faculty), promotes semesters, lists/deletes users, broadcasts announcements
- **Faculty** — creates assignments with file uploads, records attendance, uploads IA marks, views submissions, manages student roster
- **Student** — views assignments for their branch/sem, submits assignments with file uploads, views own attendance, views own marks
- **All roles** — login, view/create feed posts

