## 9. OVERALL VERDICT

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **This is a legitimate, functional MVP.** All 19 API endpoints execute real MongoDB queries — there is absolutely zero mock/fake/hardcoded data. The code is clean, well-organized, and follows consistent patterns.

### Strengths
- ✅ Clean, consistent project structure
- ✅ Every endpoint hits real MongoDB — no stubs
- ✅ Proper password hashing (bcrypt, salt 10)
- ✅ JWT auth with role-based middleware
- ✅ Cloudinary integration with graceful degradation
- ✅ Smart aggregation fix for attendance query
- ✅ Unique compound indexes preventing duplicate submissions/marks
- ✅ No dead code, no TODOs, no FIXMEs

### Critical Gaps (fix before production)
1. 🔴 **No `.gitignore`** — real DB password + Cloudinary keys in `.env` could be pushed to Git
2. 🔴 **No ownership checks on faculty delete** — any faculty can delete any faculty's assignments
3. 🟡 **Joi validation missing on 6/10 write endpoints**
4. 🟡 **No pagination** — will degrade at scale
5. 🟡 **No grading endpoint** — schema supports it but no route exists
6. 🟡 **Weak JWT secret** — easily guessable
